[11/14 15:06:10     19s] @flow 5: # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
[11/14 15:06:10     19s] @flow 6: # for batch jobs with the current flow scripts.  The LSB_MAX_NUM_PROCESSORS is
[11/14 15:06:10     19s] @flow 7: # a typical environment variable exported by distribution platforms and is
[11/14 15:06:10     19s] @flow 8: # useful for ensuring all interactive jobs are using the reserved amount of CPUs.
